</header><div class="entry-content" itemprop="text">
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The Library Board meets on the third Wednesday at 6:30 PM in the library. Meeting dates are subject to change with notice. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">If you are interested in joining the Mount Kisco Public Library Board of Trustees please contact Jennifer Brown, Library Director at <a href="mailto:jbrown@mountkiscolibrary.org" title="">jbrown@mountkiscolibrary.org</a>.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Dr. Barbara Steckel</strong>&nbsp;– President December 2028<br><a href="mailto:bsteckel@mountkiscolibrary.org" title="">bsteckel@mountkiscolibrary.org</a></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Sandra Birnbaum</strong>&nbsp;– Vice-President December 2026<br><a href="mailto:sbirnbaum@mountkiscolibrary.org" title="">sbirnbaum@mountkiscolibrary.org</a></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Luke Powell</strong>&nbsp;– Secretary December 2027<br><a href="mailto:lpowell@mountkiscolibrary.org" title="">lpowell@mountkiscolibrary.org</a></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Joyce Reed</strong>&nbsp;– Treasurer December 2028<br><a href="mailto:jreed@mountkiscolibrary.org" title="">jreed@mountkiscolibrary.org</a></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Amy Kelley</strong>&nbsp;– Trustee December 2026<br> <a href="mailto:akelley@mountkiscolibrary.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener" title="">akelley@mountkiscolibrary.org</a></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Roger Nadel</strong>&nbsp;– Trustee December 2026<br><a href="https://mountkiscolibrary.org/about/" title="About Mount Kisco Library"> rnadel@mountkiscolibrary.org</a></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Erica Vanpatten</strong>&nbsp;– Trustee December 2027<br><a href="mailto:evanpatten@mountkiscolibrary.org" title="">evanpatten@mountkiscolibrary.org</a></p>



<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>



